  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agroforestry School: Planting knowledge, cultivating solidarity, and sharing experiences</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Associao dos Agricultores Agroflorestais de Barra do Turvo e Adrianpolis (COOPERAFLORESTA) will expand its agroforestry school to offer training to its members and the opportunity to share experiences with technicians, researchers and other interested farmers. It will expand its agro-plant processing plant to expand to other markets and supply fruit pulp, ice cream and dried fruit. The project is expected to benefit at least 3,400 Brazilians directly and another 12,000 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
